{"id":"n27369-3-7","stage":0,"title":"여자 · 妻子","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n27369-3-7-1","ko":"너 요즘 만나는 여자 있지?","zh":"你最近有在交往的女生吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"요즘","meaning":"最近，近来，这阵子","explanation":"요즘：最近，近来，这阵子","readings":[{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20250","senseId":"1","lemma":"요즘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"만나는","meaning":"遇到","explanation":"만나다：遇到；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"만나다","audio":"/audio/b1bced847edb7e2eec5e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66591","senseId":"9","lemma":"만나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"여자","meaning":"妻子，情人","explanation":"여자：妻子，情人","readings":[{"term":"여자","audio":"/audio/3109db6ce062c8633018.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27369","senseId":"3","lemma":"여자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있지?","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"14","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"828c4030dd68aa7b","term":"요즘","zh":"最近，近来，这阵子","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3","entryId":"20250","definition":"从非常近的过去到现在之间。","pronunciation":["요즘"]},{"id":"b1bced847edb7e2e","term":"만나다","zh":"遇到","audio":"/audio/b1bced847edb7e2eec5e.mp3","entryId":"66591","definition":"因有缘而建立某种关系。","pronunciation":["만나다"]},{"id":"3109db6ce062c863","term":"여자","zh":"妻子，情人","audio":"/audio/3109db6ce062c8633018.mp3","entryId":"27369","definition":"一个男