法，消息","audio":"/audio/d13cec79f66edb6aa0c5.mp3","entryId":"62379","definition":"许多人共同的意见或传闻。","pronunciation":["소리"]},{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"6f24e21fc8cce6bd","term":"정말","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3","entryId":"61173","definition":"用于强调自己所说的话。","pronunciation":["정ː말"]},{"id":"97aae2f9eae59ad1","term":"애인","zh":"爱人","audio":"/audio/97aae2f9eae59ad11035.mp3","entryId":"73134","definition":"男女之间相爱的人。","pronunciation":["애ː인"]},{"id":"815560dcd5b82893","term":"없다","zh":"没有","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3","entryId":"89917","definition":"不具有某物，或不具备资格、能力。","pronunciation":["업ː따"]}],"audio":"/audio/12a3bc93dfe312570675.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":1.72,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=27369","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"3","sourceLevel":"초급","day":22,"sequenceScore":0.8615,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["你在说什么啊？我真的没有女朋友啊。","你最近有在交往的女生吧？","您的家人都是谁呢？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["你最近有在交往的女生吧？","您的家人都是谁呢？","你在说什么啊？我真的没有女朋友啊。"],"answer":2}]}
